mno-split
Target Report RejectNegative Mask(DONT_SPLIT)
Don't split instructions before second scheduling pass

msplit
Taget Report RejectNegative InverseMask(DONT_SPLIT)
Split instructions before the second scheduling pass

mbranch-hints
Target Report Mask(BRANCH_HINTS)
Generate branch hints for branches

msmall-mem
Target Report RejectNegative InverseMask(LARGE_MEM)
Generate code for 18 bit addressing

mlarge-mem
Target Report RejectNegative Mask(LARGE_MEM)
Generate code for 32 bit addressing

mvector-simplify
Target Report Mask(VECTOR_SIMPLIFY)
Try to simplify vector operations

mapusim
Target Report
Build executable for running on apusim

mcellsim
Target Report
Build executable for running on cellsim

mspusim
Target Report
Build executable for running on spusim

mtest-abi
Target Report RejectNegative Mask(TEST_ABI)
Test a different ABI (currently no effect)

;; MASK(DD2) was removed

mraw
Target Report
Use raw SPU programming model

mis
Target Report
Not documented

mspurs-job
Target Report
Build executable for SPURS job model

mspurs-job-initialize
Target Report
Build executable for SPURS job model
Build executable for SPURS job model with some extensions

mspurs-task
Target Report
Build executable for SPURS task model

mwarn-reloc
Target Report Mask(WARN_RELOC)
Emit warnings when run-time relocations are generated

merror-reloc
Target Report Mask(ERROR_RELOC)
Emit errors when run-time relocations are generated

msafe-dma
Target Report RejectNegative Mask(SAFE_DMA)
Make sure loads and stores are not moved past DMA instructions

munsafe-dma
Target Report RejectNegative
volatile must be specified on any memory that is effected by DMA

mdual-nops
Target Report Var(spu_dual_nops,10) Init(10)
Insert nops when it might improve performance by allowing dual issue (default)

mdual-nops=
Target RejectNegative Joined UInteger Var(spu_dual_nops)
Insert nops when it might improve performance by allowing dual issue (default)

mbranch-cost=
Target RejectNegative Joined UInteger Var(spu_branch_cost) Init(20)
Specify cost of branches (Default 20)

mhint-max-nops=
Target RejectNegative Joined UInteger Var(spu_max_nops) Init(2)
Maximum number of nops to insert for a hint (Default 2)

mhint-max-distance=
Target RejectNegative Joined Var(spu_max_distance_str)
Approximate maximum number of instructions to allow between a hint and its branch [125]

mfixed-range=
Target RejectNegative Joined Var(spu_fixed_range_string)
Specify range of registers to make fixed

mfloat=
Target RejectNegative Joined Var(spu_float_acc_str)
Accuracy of float operations: compat, accurate, fast

mdouble=
Target RejectNegative Joined Var(spu_double_acc_str)
Accuracy of double operations: compat, accurate, fast

msafe-hints
Target Report Mask(SAFE_HINTS)
Insert hbrp instructions after hinted branch targets to avoid the SPU hang issue

mwarn-stop0
Target Report Mask(WARN_STOP0)
Warn when using 0 as an argument to the stop instruction or intrinsics

mfixed-pic-reg
Target Report Mask(FIXED_PIC_REG)
Assume $126 has been initialized as the PIC base register

mfixups
Target 
Create fixups at link time for PIC

